      "source": [
        "# Day 3 · A review threshold you can defend\n",
        "\n",
        "A model gives scores, but a review team needs a rule: *flag this request or not*. Today we compare three ways of handling the rare default class, then pick a threshold using a teaching loss (`10 x FN + FP`) and a review capacity of 12% of requests per validation period."
      ]
    },
    {
