        "## 2. Fix the policy before looking at results\n",
        "\n",
        "The target is a default within 90 days of applying. Two rules are frozen up front: a missed default (FN) costs 10 teaching units and a false alarm (FP) costs 1, and no validation period may flag more than 12% of its requests. Folds are the same later-period folds as Day 2, so training only sees mature labels from other customers."
      ]
    },
