        "## 3. Change only the training, never the validation\n",
        "\n",
        "Three LightGBM strategies share the same features, folds, tree budget and seed. They differ only in how the rare default class is treated during training: **unweighted**, **class-weighted**, **oversampled**. Validation rows are never reweighted or resampled."
      ]
